  <footer class="gw-ft">
    <p>Logos in 000s; ARR at spot FX in $M; negatives in parentheses. LTM = Oct–Sep; QoQ stays "n.d." for a 12-month window. Logo Monthly New Adds % = (New + Recovered) ÷ average monthly BoP ÷ 12; Logo Monthly Churn % = average of the 12 monthly (Churn − Reactivated) ÷ BoP rates, from company-level classification (not raw per-segment logo counts, which double-count companies active in both Core and Lite and overstate churn). CAC = S&amp;M spend ÷ New logos; ARPA = (ARR EoP ÷ 12) ÷ Logos EoP — both summed/point-in-time as in the quarterly columns. <b>¹</b> ARR Churn, net and Logo Monthly Churn % are both net of Reactivated only (Recovered excluded, shown separately) — same convention, not a different base. <b>²</b> ARPA = MRR ÷ logos. Excludes Alanube. <b>§</b> FX impact for LTM24 is residual/estimated, not directly measured. Figures may not sum due to rounding.</p>
